### Registrar Supervisor
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "87654321",
  "password": "MiPasswordSeguro123",
  "rol": "supervisor",
  "nombres": "Ingeniero",
  "apellidos": "Prueba",
  "carrera": "Especialidad de Prueba"
}

